        "The whole accounting hangs on one fabric property: RC completions are in-order. Because only every K-th WR is signaled, one data CQE accounts for exactly K WRs — the refill reclaims exactly K per CQE, and the counters of struct bw_data_state (posted, outstanding) stay exact without any per-WR bookkeeping.",
