        "Both messages are verified twice over: the fixed tag proves \"I am a control message\", the sequence counter proves \"I belong to size i\". The messages are 8 bytes, so they ride the inline path — the HCA takes the payload from the WQE itself; bw_post_ctrl_send stages the message in the registered control area only if inline is somehow unavailable.",
